    why: "A portfolio can open doors that a marksheet does not. Work is project based, so you can start with free or small paid jobs.",
    pays: "Studios, brands, local businesses and direct clients.",
    trust: "Three finished pieces aimed at one kind of client, with notes on how each was made.",
