          <p>{m.body}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Get your marksheet read line by line, then choose one of the four routes and write down its first
    deadline. Start one real project in your lane beside it.
  </p>

  <p>
    A specialist can look at your marks, interests, budget and family situation with you, which cuts the
    guesswork after a setback. A sensible first step is
    <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-counselling-for-dropouts/">career counselling for students who need a restart</a>.
    The aim is skills that pay well and an earlier path to financial freedom, not only a pass certificate.
  </p>

  <p>
    Still unsure which skill fits? The small
    <a href="/services/assessments/">free career and skill assessments</a> give you a starting comparison.
  </p>

